				{
					"id": 412130201,
					"content": "太厉害了，这样的武器我还是第一次看到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130202,
					"content": "你也好厉害，无论是战斗的姿势还是挥剑的气势都非常完美。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130203,
					"content": "你过奖了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130204,
					"content": "这把剑好特别，明明没有想要深入研究，眼神却不知不觉就被吸引了过去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130205,
					"content": "我倒觉得比起剑的属性，这个更像是你自己的属性呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130206,
					"content": "危险诱人的神秘单手剑，嗯，不会错的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130207,
					"content": "把这么重要的东西交给你，阿贝多先生果然非常信任你呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130208,
						412130209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130208,
					"content": "对于这件事，我也很惊讶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130210,
					"content": "哼哼，这也是凭本事换来的信任吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130211,
					"content": "我也这么觉得。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130212,
					"content": "不过在交给你之前，剑还没有吸收多少能量…阿贝多先生是怎么从一堆杂物中发觉它与众不同的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130213,
					"content": "灵光一闪通常是没有道理的。比如我想吃蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130214,
					"content": "啊…这么一说，我今天还没吃过多少东西呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130215,
					"content": "忙完实验赶来找你们，却在路上遇到被困在雪地里的冒险家，为了救他又花了不少时间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130216,
					"content": "（咕…咕…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130217,
					"content": "刚才那是肚子饿了的声音吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130218,
					"content": "啊、啊啊啊！不、不是这样的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130219,
					"content": "别害羞别害羞，大胆地说出你的想法嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130220,
					"content": "呃、呃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130221,
					"content": "那我先说：肚子饿了！我想吃饭！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130222,
						412130223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130222,
					"content": "肚子饿了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130224,
					"content": "肚子…肚子饿了，要吃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130225,
					"content": "呜啊啊果然还是好丢脸啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130226,
					"content": "才没有这种事呢，承认饥饿会让食物更美味哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130227,
					"content": "咦，是这样吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130228,
					"content": "是这样哦！所以打起精神来，去休息地找食物吧~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130229,
					"content": "可以的话，真想在这冰天雪地里享用美味的蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130223,
