				{
					"id": 412130503,
					"content": "阿、阿贝多先生…我不是故意的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130504,
					"content": "砂糖，你不是在整理资料吗？怎么突然跑到这种地方来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130505,
					"content": "而且还在冰天雪地里和这么危险的对手作战…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130506,
					"content": "我、我也作战了，对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130507,
					"content": "为什么连我也跟着心虚起来了呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130508,
					"content": "呜啊啊我、我只是…对不起对不起，我就是路过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130509,
					"content": "唉，我猜，一定又有什么让你感兴趣的东西出现了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130510,
					"content": "我把剑的事告诉砂糖了，抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130511,
					"content": "你都告诉她了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130512,
					"content": "只是说了剑的属性和来历，没有让她触摸本体！这点意识我们还是有的嘛~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130513,
					"content": "算了，本来也不可能瞒她多久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130514,
					"content": "砂糖对知识和秘密很有探究精神，确实适合做炼金术研究。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130515,
					"content": "啊呜呜…我再也不敢乱惹麻烦了！用我新研究的四倍大种子甜甜花发誓！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130516,
					"content": "我不怕麻烦，只是担心你们的安全。下次千万注意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130517,
					"content": "对了，那个蹲在那里的冒险家是怎么回事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130518,
					"content": "刚才战斗中我负责保护帕拉德先生，我想，他应该没有受伤。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130519,
					"content": "冷…冷死我了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "冒失的帕拉德"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130520,
					"content": "好像是在刚才的战斗中着凉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130521,
					"content": "啊啊，这倒是没想到…是我疏忽了，非常抱歉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130522,
					"content": "阿贝多先生，我去看看他的情况！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130523,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130524,
					"content": "砂糖看起来有些死板，居然是个很有爱心的好孩子呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130525,
					"content": "不要叫比你大的人孩子哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130526
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130526,
					"content": "说得也是呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130527,
					"content": "砂糖这家伙，一不小心就会跑到奇怪的地方去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130528,
					"content": "年轻人都这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130529
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130529,
					"content": "也是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130530,
					"content": "砂糖不是故意的，请不要生气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130531,
					"content": "放心吧，我没生气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130532,
					"content": "哎？剑上面好像有什么东西在闪烁呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130533,
					"content": "嗯？又有变化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130534,
					"content": "剑上的力量比之前强大了不少。怎么回事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130535,
					"content": "我们和愚人众发生了战斗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130536
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130536,
					"content": "这一带的愚人众士兵里有些我们没见过的狠角色哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130537,
					"content": "是之前没有遇到过的力量吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130538,
					"content": "所以，剑也大幅成长了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4121306,
